ter","description":"","previewUrl":"https://cdn.21st.dev/lyanchouss/the-typewriter/default/preview.1780686622092.png","videoUrl":"https://cdn.21st.dev/lyanchouss/the-typewriter/default/video.1780686622092.mp4","author":"edwinvakayil","authorImage":"https://www.google.com/s2/favicons?domain=iconiqui.com&sz=128","installCommand":"npx shadcn@latest add \"https://21st.dev/r/edwinvakayil/the-typewriter?api_key=$API_KEY_21ST\"","url":"https://21st.dev/@edwinvakayil/components/the-typewriter"},{"type":"component","id":18600,"name":"Text Generate Effect","description":"Animated text that fades and blurs in word by word, as if being generated by AI.","previewUrl":"https://cdn.21st.dev/cnippet.dev/text-generate-effect/default/preview.1784704304064-e78681fd-c756-4756-873f-6cd36ec825c5.png","videoUrl":"https://cdn.21st.dev/cnippet.dev/text-generate-effect/default/video.1784704304064-e78681fd-c756-4756-873f-6cd36ec825c5.mp4","author":"cnippet-dev","authorImage":"https://vucvdpamtrjkzmubwlts.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/users/user_36Tbt0v8JdD4jEycmBFhR8tojnR/avatar.png","installCommand":"npx shadcn@latest add \"https://21st.dev/r/cnippet-dev/text-generate-effect?api_key=$API_KEY_21ST\"","url":"https://21st.dev/@cnippet-dev/components/text-generate-effect"},{"type":"component","id":24666,"name":"Typewriter","description":"A typewriter that types Hello world! with a blinking hue-1 caret, rebuilt from the official Motion example using motion/react.","previewUrl":"https://cdn.21st.dev/user_motion.dev/motion-typewriter/default/preview.1787592260800.webp","videoUrl":"https://cdn.21st.dev/user_motion.dev/motion-typewriter/default/video.1787592256624.mp4","author":"motiondotdev","authorImage":"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1967237939043135488/iP9UqXkF_400x400.png","installCommand":"npx shadcn@latest add \"https://21st.dev/r/motiondotdev/motion-typewriter?api_key=$API_KEY_21ST\"","url":"https://21st.dev/@motiondotdev/components/motion-typewriter"},{"type":"component","id":30151,"name":"Typer","description":"A text component that reveals a string character-by-character, with each glyph flickering through randomized filled-pill, accent, and outline states before settling into plain text.","previewUrl":"https://cdn.21st.dev/soralabs/typer/default/preview.1790165385961-ac319470-0f67-45da-aa17-0224163da8bd.png","videoUrl":"https://cdn.21st.dev/soralabs/typer/default/video.1790165385961-ac319470-0f67-45da-aa17-0224163da8bd.mp4","author":"soralabs","authorImage":"https://github.com/Axyl1410.png","installCommand":"npx shadcn@latest add \"https://21st.dev/r/soralabs/typer?api_key=$API_KEY_21ST\"","url":"https://21st.dev/@soralabs/components/typer"},{"type":"component","id":29812,"name":"Terminal Typewriter","description":"An animated terminal window that types out CLI commands and their output character-by-character, useful for showcasing install steps or quick-start guides.","previewUrl":"https://cdn.21st.dev/ziegfiroyt/terminal1/default/preview.1790123041851-7e825456-cdf7-46d7-9663-e28075028fe6.png","videoUrl":"https://cdn.21st.dev/ziegfiroyt/terminal1/default/video.1790123041851-7e825456-cdf7-46d7-9663-e28075028fe6.mp4","author":"ziegfiroyt","authorImage":"https://vucvdpamtrjkzmubwlts.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/users/user_2tM2DgTFCMuiirMNpU5lhkvxwez/avatar.png","installCommand":"npx shadcn@latest add \"https://21st.dev/r/ziegfiroyt/terminal1?api_key=$API_KEY_21ST\"","url":"https://21st.dev/@ziegfiroyt/components/terminal1"},{"type":"component","id":1482,"name":"Typewriter","description":"A component that types out a text, one letter at a time.\n\nAs a text, either a string or an array of strings can be passed to the component. The component will automatically split the text into an array of characters, and animate each letter one by one. If you pass an array of strings, the component will animate one text, delete it, then continue animating the next one. The component will loop through the texts if you set the loop prop to true.\n\nThe cursor at the end of the text is optional. You can use a character or even a svg node if you like. There is a prop to customize the cursor animation, where you have to define the two motion variants as initial and animate.\n\nIdeally, the component should respect multiple lines. If you experience otherwise, please let me know.:)","previewUrl":"https://cdn.21st.dev/user_danielpetho/typewriter/default/preview.png","videoUrl":"https://cdn.21st.dev/user_danielpetho/typewriter/default/video.mp4","author":"danielpetho","authorImage":"https://www.google.com/s2/favicons?domain=fancycomponents.dev&sz=128","installCommand":"npx shadcn@latest add \"https://21st.dev/r/danielpetho/typewriter?api_key=$API_KEY_21ST\"","url":"https://21st.dev/@danielpetho/components/typewriter"},{"type":"component","id":25,"name":"Animated Typewriter Text","description":"Animated Typewriter Text","previewUrl":"https://cdn.21st.dev/user_2rdX0nxNZVHvzWonaWWUowA52VG/text-three/default/preview.1787662399502.webp","videoUrl":"https://cdn.21st.dev/user_2rdX0nxNZVHvzWonaWWUowA52VG/text-three/default/video.1787662402747.mp4","author":"anurag-mishra22","authorImage":"https://img.clerk.com/eyJ0eXBlIjoicHJveHkiLCJzcmMiOiJodHRwczovL2ltYWdlcy5jbGVyay5kZXYvb2F1dGhfZ2l0aHViL2ltZ18ycmRYMGtJaFd3dmUyV3M5SGxPZWpEVmFLNkcifQ","installCommand":"npx shadcn@latest add \"https://21st.dev/r/anurag-mishra22/text-three?api_key=$API_KEY_21ST\"","url":"https://21st.dev/@anurag-mishra22/components/text-three"},{"type":"component","id":26071,"name":"Typing Text","description":"Multi-line terminal-style typewriter with sequential, cascade, and loop variants, configurable cursor styles, blur/rotate/scale entrance, and RTL support. Theme-aware, respects reduced motion.","previewUrl":"https://cdn.21st.dev/user_3IlVIzEF1oziaTRKTKA3Qak2f5C/typing-text/default/preview.1788448135018.webp","videoUrl":"https://cdn.21st.dev/user_3IlVIzEF1oziaTRKTKA3Qak2f5C/typing-text/default/video.1788448105002.mp4","author":"hyperiux","authorImage":